# several separate local projects, while the EAS project is only mobile/.
*
!mobile/
!mobile/**

# Build inputs are installed or generated on EAS.
mobile/node_modules/
mobile/.expo/
mobile/dist/
mobile/dist-check/
mobile/.env
mobile/android/
mobile/ios/
*.log
.git/
